================================================================================
RHEL MINOR VERSION UPGRADE REPORT
================================================================================
Hostname:           {{ ansible_fqdn }}
Upgrade Date:       {{ ansible_date_time.iso8601 }}
================================================================================

VERSION INFORMATION
-------------------
Previous Version:   {{ pre_upgrade_state.version }}
Target Version:     {{ target_version }}
Current Version:    {{ ansible_distribution_version }}
Upgrade Status:     {{ 'SUCCESS' if ansible_distribution_version is version(target_version, '>=') else 'FAILED' }}

KERNEL INFORMATION
------------------
Previous Kernel:    {{ pre_upgrade_kernel }}
Current Kernel:     {{ ansible_kernel }}
Kernel Updated:     {{ 'Yes' if pre_upgrade_kernel != ansible_kernel else 'No' }}

PACKAGE INFORMATION
-------------------
Packages Before:    {{ pre_upgrade_state.package_count }}
Packages After:     {{ post_package_count.stdout }}
Net Change:         {{ post_package_count.stdout | int - pre_upgrade_state.package_count | int }}

SYSTEM STATUS
-------------
SELinux:            {{ selinux_status.stdout }}
Subscription:       {{ 'Active' if 'Overall Status: Current' in post_subscription.stdout else 'Check Required' }}
Release Lock:       {{ post_release.stdout }}
Failed Services:    {{ failed_services_count.stdout }}

{% if failed_services_count.stdout | int > 0 %}
FAILED SERVICES
---------------
{{ failed_services_list.stdout }}
{% endif %}

BACKUP LOCATION
---------------
/var/backup/upgrade-{{ ansible_date_time.date }}/

